### ==================== CREATE PROGRAM ====================

POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/programs
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Linear Search",
    "topic": "Searching",
    "language": "C++",
    "code": "#include <iostream>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    int arr[] = {10, 20, 30, 40, 50};\n    int key = 30;\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n        if (arr[i] == key) {\n            cout << \"Element found at index \" << i;\n            return 0;\n        }\n    }\n\n    cout << \"Element not found\";\n    return 0;\n}",
    "user": "6aa1283662e110305fa87e1a"
}


### ==================== GET ALL PROGRAMS ====================

GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/programs


### ==================== GET PROGRAM BY ID ====================

GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/programs/YOUR_PROGRAM_ID_HERE